Package: fasttwfeR
Type: Package
Title: Native TWFE Reference Estimation and Inference
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Matthew D.", "Webb", email = "matt.webb@carleton.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Independent base R implementation of static difference-in-differences
    estimation with estimator-specific clustered covariance, complete cluster
    deletion, and assignment-explicit randomization inference. Development software.
